<title>USA: TCI reports prelim Q3 on cable unit.</title>
<headline>TCI reports prelim Q3 on cable unit.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc said TCI Communications Inc, which represents its core cable operations, is expected to post operating cash flow of $591 million, according to preliminary figures.</p>
<p>&quot;Overall, the third quarter shows strong revenue growth in TCIC's core cable operations and major progress on its new product introductions,&quot; said Brendan Clouston, chief executive of TCI Communications.</p>
</text>
